WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Sungula ethankini. Yi hlayisa mati yo cheleta swimilana.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Mati ma huma ethankini. Xisefo xi khoma sava.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Landzelela mati loko ma khuluka endzeni ka phayiphi leyi nga etlhelweni ka swimilana.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Ehansi ka byanyi byo funengeta misava, mati ma thona hi ku nonoka exithonisini.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Mati ma nghena emisaveni. Vona ndlela leyi misava leyi rhendzeleke timitsu yi tsakamaka ha yona.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Mati ma suka ethankini, ma hundza hi phayiphi, ma fika etimitsweni. Ndlela yi sala yi omile.
